  m_Name: Obstructed line of sight while carrying materials
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hazardName: Obstructed line of sight while carrying materials
  description: When carrying materials, it is important to maintain a clear line
    of sight in order to notice obstacles in time and prevent accidents such as tripping,
    collisions, and falls. Loads should be positioned so they do not block vision
    and, when necessary, carried in smaller portions to ensure safety and maintain
    workflow.
